*COPY MAILEQU
         TITLE 'EQUates used in MAILER'
*
*        EQUates for the RXVGET/RXVPUT routines.
*
RXVSTR   EQU  1                    Parameter is a string.
RXVNUM   EQU  2                    Parameter is a fullword.
*
*        EQUates for the MAILCMD* routines.
*
CMDCONS  EQU  0                    Command is from the console.
CMDSMSG  EQU  1                    Command is from SMSG.
CMDNET   EQU  2                    Command is from the network.
